WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.545
Enemies to The East

00:00:08.915 --> 00:00:10.535
Enemies to The West

00:00:12.655 --> 00:00:14.135
Enemies to The South

00:00:16.195 --> 00:00:17.795
Enemies to The North

00:00:20.155 --> 00:00:21.945
Whatever stands in our way,

00:00:23.175 --> 00:00:24.825
we will defeat.

00:00:27.135 --> 00:00:28.915
We're the last Lannisters.

00:00:31.055 --> 00:00:32.515
The last ones who count.

00:00:35.885 --> 00:00:37.385
 

00:00:38.395 --> 00:00:41.745
I was born to rule the seven kingdoms,

00:00:43.405 --> 00:00:44.515
and i will.

00:00:49.805 --> 00:00:50.805
THE KING IN THE NORTH!!!

00:00:52.105 --> 00:00:54.395
Your father and brothers are gone, yet here you stand,

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.180
last, best hope against the coming storm.

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:08.340
If we don't put aside our enmities and bound together, we will die.

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:14.040
And then it doesn't matter whose skeleton sits on the Iron Throne.

00:01:31.425 --> 00:01:33.515
The Great War is here.

00:01:34.695 --> 00:01:35.695
 

